WEBVTT

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.420
The Maiami Championship has finally started.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:12.520
Powerful duelists from LDS and 
the city's other duel schools

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.430
have gathered after meeting 
the entrance requirements.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:22.160
I was suddenly chosen to 
give the player's oath.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:29.710
I want to become a great pro duelist like 
Yusyo Sakaki that people will be proud of!

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.560
I want to become a duelist that will 
make me and everyone love dueling!

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.700
I was moved, Yuya!

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.790
Everyone, be like Yuya 
and get fired up to win!

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:45.320
You Show School's first competitor was me!

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:49.090
Let's battle!  Tyranno attacks you directly!

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.580
I got shivers!

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:00.640
How's that!  I made my opponent shiver!

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.140
You're next, Ayu!  Good luck!

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:13.190
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:18.010
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:21.060
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.360
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:44.140
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:47.550
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:56.290
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:01:56.290 --> 00:02:00.860
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.060
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:08.270
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:19.020
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:25.950
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:29.890
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:33.290
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:43.570
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.910
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:56.960
Ayu's Entertainment Aquarium

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.360
Okay...

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.840
Good!  I finished charging up!

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:13.320
Ayu is full of fighting spirit.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:17.380
It's because I won in a way 
that made everyone shiver.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.300
That's why she has fighting spirit.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.400
Teacher!

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.360
Thank you for always looking 
after our daughter.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:27.940
Ayu's Mom and Dad!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.580
Ayu is cute again today.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:32.790
C'mon, say hello to the teacher!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.960
No, make sure to film her.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.700
This is Ayu's big moment.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.290
Since Ayu is learning Action 
Duels from You Show School,

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.100
I have no doubt that she'll become a star.

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:49.270
So today's duel will be valuable footage!

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.360
Ayu is already the star of our household.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.620
Ayu!  Look this way!

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.720
So cute!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:01.030
Good luck!  Fight, Ayu!

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:02.190
Sheesh...

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.930
What's up with this?

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:11.060
Fierce battles continue in the 
Maiami Junior Championship!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:17.100
Next up are first-timers in the 
Junior Championship: Ayu and Layra!

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.740
I'm looking forward to seeing how they duel!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:26.550
I expect big things from Layra because 
he's known as LDS's favorite!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.060
LDS?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.900
Ayu, we can't lose against LDS!

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.990
Do whatever it takes to win!  
Get your blood boiling!

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.030
All right.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:39.960
Even when she's fired up, she's still cute!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:43.140
Ayu enters the field, full of energy!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.720
And Layra is...

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.200
Huh?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.600
Is something wrong?

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.200
Are you nervous?

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:55.540
What's wrong with her opponent?

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.120
It's like he's afraid of something.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.280
Afraid?  Of Ayu?

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:03.780
When Ayu is angry, she's so 
scary that it gives me shivers.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.920
When Ayu is angry, she's scary cute!

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.750
Mister, be quiet.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:12.320
Layra, are you ready?

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.600
Umm...

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.260
Huh?

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.420
Okay, I'm going to try my best!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.890
Ayu, fight!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.200
We'll first select the Action Field.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.700
Action Field on!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:52.040
This is the Field Spell Sun Valley.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:56.540
I hope Ayu and Layra both 
duel with lots of energy!

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.720
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.980
Along with their monsters, 
they'll kick the ground...

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:12.320
...and fly through the sky 
to move around the field!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.310
Wit...

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.500
Wit...ness...

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.660
...dueling's greatest evolution!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.590
Action!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:22.960
Duel.

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.360
Okay, it's my turn!

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.470
I summon Aquaactress Guppy from my hand!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.900
I'm sorry, Guppy.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.660
I brought you to a place 
where you can get sunburned.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.820
I'll put you in water quickly.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:52.360
Next, I activate the Continuous 
Spell Aquarium Stage from my hand!

00:06:56.180 --> 00:07:00.700
Due to Aquarium Stage, my 
Water Attribute monsters

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.000
can only be destroyed in battle against 
other Water Attribute monsters!

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.480
I'm not done!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:12.080
I activate the Continuous Spell Aquarium Set!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.460
Due to Aquarium Set's effect,

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:36.920
Aquaactress monsters on the 
field gain 600 attack points.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:42.410
Then I activate the Continuous 
Spell Aquarium Lighting!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:49.850
When an Aquaactress monster battles, 
Aquarium Lighting doubles its attack points.

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:54.560
Aquaactress Guppy attacks you directly!

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.500
Why is there an error?

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:08.470
Ayu, when you go first, you're not 
allowed to attack on the first turn.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.170
Oh yeah.  Oops, I made a mistake.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.120
Even when she makes a 
mistake, she's still cute!

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.480
Ayu...

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.650
She's such a klutz that it gives me shivers.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.680
Don't worry about it, Ayu!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.900
Failure is the root of success.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.620
Don't worry and keep going!

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:34.730
Ayu, everyone makes mistakes!  Stay calm!

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.320
Right, Principal!

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:40.930
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:44.320
My turn.  I draw.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:54.340
I activate the spell card 
Shutter Layer 1 from my hand.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:59.930
This card copies your monster entirely.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:06.360
But when the selected monster leaves 
the field, this card is destroyed.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:10.530
I select Aquaactress Guppy.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:27.410
Hooray!  There are more fish in my aquarium!

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:33.200
You can summon the most powerful 
monster, but that card will copy it.

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.890
Maybe he's really skilled.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:41.440
Due to Aquarium Set's effect, Aquaactress 
monsters gain 600 attack points.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:46.330
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.800
My turn.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.040
I draw!

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:56.080
I'll have more fish in my aquarium.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:59.210
I summon Aquaactress Tetra!

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:07.740
Due to the Continuous Spell Aquarium Set's 
effect, Tetra gains 600 attack points.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:10.590
It gained attack points, but...

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.630
It's not enough against the copied Guppy.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:17.360
When Guppies with the same 
attack points battle,

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:23.460
Aquarium Lighting doubles both 
Aquaactresses' attack points.

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.610
They will destroy each other.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.280
That means...

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.540
I need an Action Card.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:36.780
Okay.  I'm going to search for Action Cards!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.420
Where can it be?

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.580
Where can it be...

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:45.960
I found one!

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.200
I got an Action Card!

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.140
I'm back!

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.170
Let's battle!

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:58.640
I attack Layra's Guppy 
with Aquaactress Guppy.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:03.810
I activate the Action Spell Sunshine Smile!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:09.280
With this card, a monster gains 
400 attack points during battle!

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:13.070
Nice!  The opponent will 
take 400 points of damage!

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:14.570
No, you're wrong!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.790
Due to the Continuous Spell 
Aquarium Lighting's effect,

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:22.760
Aquaactress's attack points 
double when it battles!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.730
Go, Guppy!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:37.860
Next, Aquaactress Tetra attacks you directly!

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.220
All right!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:45.000
She did it!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.440
Her victory pose is also cute!

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:53.400
How do you like You Show School's 
entertainment dueling that utilizes Action Cards?

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:59.680
Everyone watching on TV!  Contact You 
Show School if you want to apply!

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:01.030
Stop that!

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:06.600
I expected more from the copy 
monster, but it's nothing special.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:12.980
Aquarium Lighting and Sunshine Smile's 
effects only work during battle.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:16.020
Guppy's attack points return to normal.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.180
I end my turn.

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:22.740
I'll end my turn too.

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:25.620
What's up, Sora?  Are you 
going to the bathroom?

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.200
I'll look around the other arenas.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:33.100
I'll check if You Show School will 
have to face any strong opponents.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.380
Hey!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.000
My turn.  I draw.

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:45.220
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Shutter Layer 2 from my hand.

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:53.300
Card effects on your field 
can't affect your cards.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:01.160
The aquarium that I built!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.500
The aquarium that I built!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.660
Guppy!  Tetra!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:22.780
I activate the spell card 
Shutter Layer 1 from my hand.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:24.520
It's the same card as last time.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:28.580
I use this card to copy Aquaactress Guppy.

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:36.230
Due to Aquarium Set's effect, my 
Guppy gains 600 attack points.

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:41.620
Huh?  I thought Ayu's Continuous 
Spells were all negated.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:42.940
You're wrong.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:47.670
Only cards on Ayu's field aren't affected.

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:53.150
It's my Continuous Spell, 
but only he gets stronger?

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.880
That's so unfair that it gives me shivers!

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:58.140
Battle.

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:01.820
Guppy attacks Tetra.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:06.960
Ayu!

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.660
Ayu, hang in there!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.230
Get your blood boiling!

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.260
Fight!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:20.260
Ayu!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.860
It's fine because you're cute!

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.160
Do your best!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:26.730
Ayu, if you make a comeback, 
that's entertainment!

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:27.850
Exactly!

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.760
Everyone...

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:34.090
That's right.  I'm a member 
of You Show School.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:38.290
Just like Yuya, I'll make 
an entertaining comeback!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:42.030
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:50.160
I tribute Guppy to Tribute 
Summon Aquaactress Arowana!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:59.180
When your monster that I copied leaves 
the field, Shutter Layer 1 is destroyed.

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.460
She caught a large fish!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:16.110
Nice!  Her Tribute Summon sent 
the copy to the graveyard,

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:18.430
so she killed two birds with one stone!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.130
Let's battle.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.840
Aquaactress Arowana attacks you directly.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:24.880
All right!

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.540
This is the comeback!

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:30.910
I activate the trap Instant Shutter.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.740
When I take a direct attack,

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:40.920
this card transforms into your attacking 
monster and is Special Summoned to my field.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:47.130
Due to Aquarium Set's effect, 
Arowana gains 600 attack points.

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:51.240
Then I'll also activate a trap.

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:53.200
Aqua Story - Urashima.

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:59.370
By banishing two Level 4-or-below 
Aquaactress monsters from my graveyard,

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:02.020
your monster's attack points become 100.

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:06.840
I banish Guppy and Tetra from my graveyard!

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.180
She set that card?

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:13.020
She's playing well!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.490
Due to Aqua Story - Urashima,

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:21.960
effects that change your monster's 
attack points don't work this turn!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:27.130
Aquaactress Arowana attacks granny Arowana!

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:40.440
You did it!  Nice, Ayu!

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.480
I end my turn.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.930
My turn.  I draw.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:16.860
I summon C/C Critical Eye from my hand!

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:25.500
What's that monster?

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:28.060
It's so eerie that it gives me shivers.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:32.080
I activate Montage Fusion from my hand!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:37.640
With this card's effect, I film your Arowana!

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:42.980
Then I fuse the Arowana that 
I filmed with Critical Eye!

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.960
The river conqueror with shining scales,

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:50.440
reside in my eye and offer me your power!

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:54.400
Fusion Summon!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.160
Appear!

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:00.700
The Water Sword that slices 
through everything!

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:04.800
C/C/C Water Sword of Battle!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:14.780
Let's battle!  Water Sword of Battle 
attacks Aquaactress Arowana!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.360
Ayu's Arowana will be destroyed!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:20.320
But Ayu has 1900 life points.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.580
She can survive 400 points of damage.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:25.550
When Water Sword attacks,

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:32.320
it gains the attack points of all other 
Water Attribute monsters on the field.

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:37.500
The only other Water Attribute 
monster is Ayu's Arowana.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:44.720
By gaining its 2000 attack points, Water 
Sword's attack points become 4400.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.170
That means Ayu will be...

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.540
Teacher!

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:23.180
It's fine.  The Junior Class's 
Solid Vision is soft.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:26.150
Ayu, are you okay?

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:31.150
Everyone, I'm sorry.  I...

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.860
I tried my best, but I lost.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:42.140
Ayu, when you lose, just win tomorrow.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:47.930
Believe that you'll win 
tomorrow and take a step.

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.060
That's right.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:54.960
Yuya has lost countless duels 
against the man Gongenzaka.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.500
You didn't need to say that!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.350
My line was a great finisher!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:15.960
Let's interview the winner, Layra!

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:19.040
Layra, how do you feel?

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:24.820
Umm...  This is the winner's interview.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.400
You can also use Fusion Summon?

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.460
That's incredible...

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.960
Keep it up.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.900
Big brother...

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:02.660
I didn't want to lose to an LDS duelist.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:06.520
Dad, I'll get Ayu's revenge.

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:12.560
I promise to defeat LDS... 
to defeat Masumi Koutsu!

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.450
Yeah!  I'm counting on you!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.140
Yuzu gives me shivers!

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:20.430
Let's go.  Yuzu's match 
is on the center court.

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:21.600
Wait.

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:23.660
Where's Sora?

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:26.900
He said that he was going to 
look at the other matches.

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:29.420
Sheesh.

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:33.180
Hmm...

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:39.100
There are no interesting duelists like Yuya.

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:43.760
What's this about?

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:45.640
Hello!

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:46.520
Sora!

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:49.460
My match is next, so hurry up and come!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.000
If my student Yuzu is going to duel,

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.460
then I have to watch because I'm her master.

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:18.980
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:28.460
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.350 --> 00:22:40.470
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:45.710
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:51.150
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:56.380
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.590 --> 00:23:02.010
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:06.430
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:12.400
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:17.810
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:23.110
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:32.450
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:40.700
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.240
Masumi was Syun Kurosaki's rival.

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:53.260
But she now says that he's 
been with LDS since long ago.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:23:54.900
What's going on?

00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:57.700
Your eyes are clouded.

00:23:57.700 --> 00:24:02.960
I have to focus!  I lost last time 
because I was worried that Yuya was Ute!

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:07.630
Masumi, I'll show you that I'm 
different than before in this duel!

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:11.700
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Fusing Maestra!

00:24:11.860 --> 00:24:13.860
The fun is only getting started!
